1
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:56,720
Run! We're going to miss our flight!

2
00:00:57,420 --> 00:01:00,400
I'm running as fast as I can, man!

3
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:03,820
Gate 24, hurry up! Boarding closes soon.

4
00:01:04,520 --> 00:01:07,760
My boarding pass is on my phone. Got it!

5
00:01:08,460 --> 00:01:11,700
Phew, made it! Just in the nick of time.

6
00:01:12,400 --> 00:01:15,120
That was close! My heart is pounding.

7
00:04:25,000 --> 00:04:27,460
Can't believe we almost missed it.

8
00:04:28,160 --> 00:04:30,880
Good thing we ran like crazy people.

9
00:04:31,580 --> 00:04:34,820
Now we just wait for our row to board.

10
00:04:35,520 --> 00:04:38,240
I'm so ready for this vacation, though.

11
00:04:38,940 --> 00:04:42,180
Me too. Just need to relax after that sprint.

12
00:04:42,880 --> 00:04:45,860
At least we have window seats! Look out.

13
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:14,720
Where's my suitcase? I don't see it.

14
00:08:15,420 --> 00:08:18,400
Mine's here. Did you check all the tags?

15
00:08:19,100 --> 00:08:21,820
Yeah, it's definitely not on this carousel.

16
00:08:22,520 --> 00:08:25,500
Oh no. Looks like your bag is lost.

17
00:08:26,200 --> 00:08:28,660
Seriously? This is just great. Ugh.

18
00:08:29,360 --> 00:08:32,080
Don't panic yet. Let's talk to someone.

19
00:12:28,000 --> 00:12:30,720
Excuse me, I can't find my luggage.

20
00:12:31,420 --> 00:12:34,400
Can I see your baggage claim tag, please?

21
00:12:35,100 --> 00:12:38,080
Here it is. It's a black roller bag.

22
00:12:38,780 --> 00:12:41,500
Okay, we'll file a report for you.

23
00:12:42,200 --> 00:12:45,180
This is such a hassle. What a pain.

24
00:12:45,880 --> 00:12:49,120
At least they're helping. Let's hope it turns up.

